WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.487
A core outcome of this investigation is the Section 504 Prosecution.

00:00:05.437 --> 00:00:12.812
Twenty-eight counts of criminal liability have been leveled against a Military Police investigator and a Crown Prosecutor.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:20.612
Under the Canadian Criminal Code, civilians hold the legal authority to lay charges when the system refuses to police itself.
